{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49866","headline":"蝶恋花 四 · 冯延巳","name":"蝶恋花 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"几日行云何处去，忘了归来，不道春将暮。\n百草千花寒食路，香车系在谁家树。\n泪眼倚楼频独语，双燕飞来，陌上相逢否。\n撩乱春愁如柳絮，悠悠梦里无寻处。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯延巳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49866.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49866","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}